                    "title": "例1",
                    "source_description": "例1",
                    "source_order": 1,
                    "source_type": "textbook_example",
                    "skill_id": "vh_數學B2_SubSection_1_4_3",
                    "correct_answer": "",
                    "detailed_solution": "\\(\\o\\ac(○,解)\\) (1)由\\(y=sinx\\)的圖形可知：\n 當\\(0ʰ\\)（第一象限角）時\n \\(y=sinx\\)為遞增函數\n 即角度愈大\n \\(y=sinx\\)的值也愈大\n 故\\(sin10{}^\\circ < sin50{}^\\circ < sin80{}^\\circ\\)\n(2) 由\\(y=cosx\\)的圖形可知：\n當\\(0{}^\\circ < x < 90{}^\\circ\\)（第一象限角）時，\\(y=cosx\\)為遞減函數\n即角度愈大\n\\(y=cosx\\)的值反而愈小\n又\\(sin40{}^\\circ =cos50{}^\\circ\\)\n即\\(cos10{}^\\circ >cos50{}^\\circ >cos80{}^\\circ\\)\n故\\(cos10{}^\\circ >sin40{}^\\circ >cos80{}^\\circ\\)",
                    "mapping_status": "structurally_bound",
                    "needs_skill_resolution": false,
                    "notes": "{\"anchor\": \"例1\", \"needs_skill_resolution\": false, \"section_outline_skill_id\": null, \"skill_assignment_status\": \"structurally_bound\", \"source_order\": 1}"
                  }
