                    "detailed_solution": "\\(\\o\\ac(○,解)\\) 將原式因式分解得\n\\(\\left ( { 2sin\\theta -1 } \\right )\\left ( { sin\\theta -2 } \\right )=0\\)\n得\\(sin\\theta =\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)或\\(sin\\theta =2\\)，但\\(-1\\le sin\\theta \\le 1\\)，故\\(sin\\theta =\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)",
